---
description: Search the local Markdown knowledge library and answer from relevant saved notes
argument-hint: "<topic or question>"
---
Search the private Markdown knowledge library under `~/.pi/memory/` for information
relevant to:

$ARGUMENTS

Load the `persistent-memory` skill and follow its focused recall workflow. If no
topic or question was provided, ask what should be recalled.

Summarize only relevant saved knowledge, cite note paths, and distinguish
potentially stale library material from facts verified against current sources.
Say explicitly when no matching knowledge exists. This is read-only: do not create
a revision or modify the library.
